an initial sysroot and omits the new target stamp. Merge the host files,
exclude supplied components for cross targets selected by this run, and
install the actual target stamp. Preserve other targets and native objects
already prepared in the output sysroot. Non-local-rebuild paths are unchanged.
Rust source licenses and upstream identifiers are preserved.

